{"_v":1,"id":"oh-mary-west-end-2025","bd":{"positive":8,"mixed":2,"negative":2},"rv":[{"cn":"Matt Wolf","o":"The New York Times","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/12/19/theater/oh-mary-trafalgar-theater-london.html","d":"2025-12-19","q":"It's the raciest, rudest, most rip-roaringly funny show in town."},{"cn":"Dominic Cavendish","o":"The Telegraph","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/oh-mary-trafalgar-theatre-review/","d":"2025-12-19","q":"American actor Mason Alexander Park gives the funniest performance in town."},{"cn":"Nick","o":"Evening Standard","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/oh-mary-trafalgar-theatre-review-b1263289.html","d":"2025-12-20","q":"Park is a force of nature... makes her as riveting as a tractor beam."},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":35,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/oh-mary-review-west-end-6f6nt9v9f","d":"2025-12-19","q":"Some of the physical humour is worth a chuckle."},{"cn":"Patrick Marmion","o":"Daily Mail","s":14,"b":"Pan","t":1,"u":"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-15399549/PATRICK-MARMION-reviews-Oh-Mary-Trafalgar-Studios-London-fatuous-travesty-proves-not-glitters-Broadway-gold-mugging-Manhattan-bringing-infantile-comedy-West-End.html","d":"2025-12-19","q":"Not only fake news, it’s fake entertainment."},{"cn":"Marianka Swain","o":"London Theatre","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/oh-mary-review-trafalgar-theatre","d":"2025-12-20","q":"That really sums up this entertaining romp: it’s a wildly unlikely sensation."},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/oh-mary-review-there-is-nothing-else-like-it-in-the-west-end_1707130/","d":"2025-12-18","q":"It’s silly, irreverent, and utterly irresistible, full of shocks and surprises."},{"cn":"Holly O'Mahony","o":"The Stage","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/oh-mary-review-trafalgar-theatre-london","d":"2025-12-19","q":"Park’s Mary is riveting, and just as watchable during fiery exchanges with her husband (a no-nonsense Giles Terera), as in giddy lessons with her acting teacher (Dino Fetscher) and when bullying her chaperone (Kate O’Donnell)."},{"cn":"Alice Saville","o":"The Independent","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/oh-mary-trafalgar-theatre-review-b2887170.html","d":"2025-12-19","q":"This imaginary version of Mary is a captivating creation – melodramatic, childish, and monstrously self-absorbed."},{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/oh-mary-2-review","d":"2025-12-18","q":"But that's not the same thing as living up to the hype."},{"cn":"Demetrios Matheou","o":"The Arts Desk","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://theartsdesk.com/theatre/oh-mary-trafalgar-theatre-review-uproarious-farce","d":"2025-12-19","q":"This is a gloriously eccentric, rude, riotous marvel – laugh-out loud and daft as a brush."},{"cn":"Greg Stewart","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theatreweekly.com/review-oh-mary-at-trafalgar-theatre-london/","d":"2025-12-18","q":"This is not a play for everyone."}],"au":{"score":86,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":86,"c":492,"sr":4.3}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/1dUx0v29TZFwE6qhVpshCF/9477837be6a95b86ef2619b558be0455/8447_04_OhMary_TTG_1440x580_v3_copy.jpg?fm=webp&q=90","pd":"2025-12-05","ca":[{"n":"John Cameron Mitchell","r":"Mary Todd Lincoln"},{"n":"Simu Liu","r":"Mary's Teacher"},{"n":"John-Andrew Morrison","r":"Mary's Husband"},{"n":"Jenn Harris","r":"Mary's Chaperone"},{"n":"Tony Macht","r":"Mary's Husband's Assistant"}]}